# OpenTripMap API Key (required)
# Get your free key at: https://dev.opentripmap.org/register
OPENTRIPMAP_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# ── No other API keys needed! ──
# The following services are completely free with no authentication:
# • Weather forecasts     → Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com)
# • Currency conversion   → Frankfurter / ECB (frankfurter.dev)
# • Travel routing        → OSRM (project-osrm.org)
# • Country information   → REST Countries (restcountries.com)
# • Timezone lookup       → timezonefinder (offline, no API)
# • Flight/train/bus est. → Haversine math (no API)
